    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Dawn_of_Defiance\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Dawn of Defiance\">Star Wars Saga Edition Dawn of Defiance</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Echoes_of_the_Jedi\" title=\"Echoes of the Jedi\">Echoes of the Jedi</a>)</i> </p><p>The Red Fury Brotherhood is as cutthroat as they come. Reddjak has taken on many violent outcasts and turned the alien pariahs into stone-hearted killers. These corsairs are trained to board in space with space suits or force their victims onto a planet surface where they can fight in the open. Complete with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vibrorapiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vibrorapiers\">Vibrorapiers</a>, cybernetic eye patches, blasters, and a stench that could bowl over a bantha, these pirates are seasoned pros, anxious to loot their first catch of the day. </p><p>The Red Fury Brotherhood is currently the most potent buccaneer organization operating out of the Cularin System. Reddjak's cut a deal with Inquisitor Draco to guard the space above <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Almas\" title=\"Almas\">Almas</a> while the Imperials investigate the Jedi Academy ruins. </p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Red_Fury_Heroic_Units\">Red Fury Heroic Units</span></h2><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heroic_Units\" title=\"Heroic Units\">Heroic Units</a></i> </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>AFFILIATION NOTES </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dawn of Defiance\">Dawn of Defiance</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reddjak\" title=\"Reddjak\">Reddjak</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 7 </td> \n   <td>A ship is only as effective as its captain, and Reddjak is both overconfident and anxious to make a name for himself. </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Red_Fury_Nonheroic_Units\">Red Fury Nonheroic Units</span></h2><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Nonheroic_Units\" title=\"Nonheroic Units\">Nonheroic Units</a></i> </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>AFFILIATION NOTES </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dawn of Defiance\">Dawn of Defiance</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Red_Fury_Pirate\" title=\"Red Fury Pirate\">Red Fury Pirate</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 5 </td> \n   <td><i>These are pirates from straight out of the holodramas.</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Red_Fury_Vehicles\">Red Fury Vehicles</span></h2><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a></i> </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>VEHICLE TYPE </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"4\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dawn of Defiance\">Dawn of Defiance</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Modified_Z-95_Headhunter\" title=\"Modified Z-95 Headhunter\">Modified Z-95 Headhunter</a> </td> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starfighter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starfighter\">Starfighter</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 7 </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Blood_Brother\" title=\"The Blood Brother\">The <i>Blood Brother</i></a> </td> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Space_Transport\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Space Transport\">Space Transport</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 8 <